To start the app
```
npm run dev
```

To update packages

npm outdated



This tells you what a package expects before you install it:

```
npm info lodash@latest peerDependencies
```

This simulates the install and will surface ERESOLVE errors
without touching anything. 
```
npm install @vitejs/plugin-react@latest --dry-run
```

# Install specific version
npm install express@4.18.2